  {
   "id": "a04-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 96,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. No LFA",
   "originalText": "1. No LFA",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 200,
   "width": 682,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "N:  dist(N,D) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,D)   →   6 < 2 + 4 = 6   fails (tie)",
   "originalText": "N:  dist(N,D) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,D)   →   6 < 2 + 4 = 6   fails (tie)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 230,
   "width": 681,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2. Link-protecting Remote LFA (A3) picks B, which goes through E",
   "originalText": "2. Link-protecting Remote LFA (A3) picks B, which goes through E",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 264,
   "width": 692,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "P(S) = {N}   extended via N = {N, B, C}   Q(E) = {B, C, D}   PQ = {B, C}\nbest = B via N: c(S,N) + dist(N,B) = 2 + 3 = 5     (C via N: 2 + 6 = 8)",
   "originalText": "P(S) = {N}   extended via N = {N, B, C}   Q(E) = {B, C, D}   PQ = {B, C}\nbest = B via N: c(S,N) + dist(N,B) = 2 + 3 = 5     (C via N: 2 + 6 = 8)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 314,
   "width": 426,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "3. Node checks for every Y in Q(E) (B12)",
   "originalText": "3. Node checks for every Y in Q(E) (B12)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 348,
   "width": 807,
   "height": 120,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Y   a) tunnel avoids E  (via N)         b) Y’s path to D avoids E           node PQ?\n    dist(N,Y) < dist(N,E) + dist(E,Y)   dist(Y,D) < dist(Y,E) + dist(E,D)\n--  ----------------------------------  ----------------------------------  --------\nB   3 < 4 + 1 = 5   ✓                   3 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✗ (B → E → D)      no\nC   6 < 4 + 4 = 8   ✓                   3 < 4 + 2 = 6   ✓                  yes\nD   own 4 < 2+2 ✗,  via N 6 < 4+2 ✗      –                                  no",
   "originalText": "Y   a) tunnel avoids E  (via N)         b) Y’s path to D avoids E           node PQ?\n    dist(N,Y) < dist(N,E) + dist(E,Y)   dist(Y,D) < dist(Y,E) + dist(E,D)\n--  ----------------------------------  ----------------------------------  --------\nB   3 < 4 + 1 = 5   ✓                   3 < 1 + 2 = 3   ✗ (B → E → D)      no\nC   6 < 4 + 4 = 8   ✓                   3 < 4 + 2 = 6   ✓                  yes\nD   own 4 < 2+2 ✗,  via N 6 < 4+2 ✗      –                                  no",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-16",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 478,
   "width": 789,
   "height": 20,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 126704,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1675664,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "c) Y must also not have the overload bit set (RFC 7490 §5.4). Ties count as \"may use E\".",
   "originalText": "c) Y must also not have the overload bit set (RFC 7490 §5.4). Ties count as \"may use E\".",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-17",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 508,
   "width": 96,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
