   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1885122,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Node-protecting PQ = {C}. Best = C, out via N, cost c(S,N) + dist(N,C) = 2 + 6 = 8. The repair S → N →\nB → C → D costs 11. If router E fails, it still gets through, where the tunnel to B breaks at B. The\nrow shows rlfa.protects = node.",
   "originalText": "Node-protecting PQ = {C}. Best = C, out via N, cost c(S,N) + dist(N,C) = 2 + 6 = 8. The repair S → N →\nB → C → D costs 11. If router E fails, it still gets through, where the tunnel to B breaks at B. The\nrow shows rlfa.protects = node.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
