   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The node checks in full (B12)",
   "originalText": "The node checks in full (B12)",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-53",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 810,
   "width": 467,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 419707,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5550637,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "a) The tunnel to Y avoids E. Either S’s own path:",
   "originalText": "a) The tunnel to Y avoids E. Either S’s own path:",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-54",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 842,
   "width": 297,
   "height": 19,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 427626,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5655366,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dist(S,Y) < dist(S,E) + dist(E,Y)",
   "originalText": "dist(S,Y) < dist(S,E) + dist(E,Y)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-55",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 871,
   "width": 448,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 435545,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5760095,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "or through a neighbor N ≠ E (same exits as A3):",
   "originalText": "or through a neighbor N ≠ E (same exits as A3):",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-56",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 903,
   "width": 333,
   "height": 38,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 443464,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5864824,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dist(N,Y) < dist(N,E) + dist(E,Y)\nand dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)",
   "originalText": "dist(N,Y) < dist(N,E) + dist(E,Y)\nand dist(N,Y) < dist(N,S) + dist(S,Y)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-57",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 951,
   "width": 286,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 451383,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5969553,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "b) Y’s own path to D avoids E:",
   "originalText": "b) Y’s own path to D avoids E:",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-58",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 983,
   "width": 297,
   "height": 19,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 459302,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6074282,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "dist(Y,D) < dist(Y,E) + dist(E,D)",
   "originalText": "dist(Y,D) < dist(Y,E) + dist(E,D)",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-59",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1012,
   "width": 219,
   "height": 22,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 467221,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6179011,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "c) Y is not overloaded.",
   "originalText": "c) Y is not overloaded.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-text-60",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 18,
   "y": 1044,
   "width": 484,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 475140,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 6283740,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The second test in a) is the link rule of A3. RFC 8102\n§2.2.6.2 only states the first; keeping both is\nstricter, never looser.",
   "originalText": "The second test in a) is the link rule of A3. RFC 8102\n§2.2.6.2 only states the first; keeping both is\nstricter, never looser.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "a04-rectangle-61",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 553,
   "y": 754,
   "width": 533,
   "height": 394,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
